"""Bind six dated coverage entries to scoped qualification and successor evidence."""
from pathlib import Path
import json,hashlib
P=Path('docs/planning');O=P/'campaign3-history-chronology-relationship-history-rev1'
def load(p):return json.loads(Path(p).read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig'))
def ref(p):return dict(path=Path(p).as_posix(),sha256=hashlib.sha256(Path(p).read_bytes()).hexdigest())
def save(n,v):
    p=O/n
    if p.exists():assert load(p)==v,p
    else:p.write_text(json.dumps(v,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n',encoding='utf-8',newline='\n')
roles={x['path']:x for x in load(P/'campaign3-history-source-roles-rev313/index.json')['roleAssignments']}
def evidence(*names):
    result=[]
    for name in names:
        p=P/name;r=roles[p.as_posix()]
        assert ref(p)['sha256']==r['sha256']
        for x in r.get('evidence',[]):assert ref(x['path'])['sha256']==x['sha256']
        result.append(dict(**ref(p),sourceRole=r))
    return result
sections=[
 (3459,3492,'RELIANCE HISTORY',evidence('CAMPAIGN3_RELIANCE_HISTORY_QUALIFICATION.md'),'Six exactly reused models22 new public runs176 prefixes change prospective entrust distributions from own admitted commitment outcomes,not enacted delegation/general trust. Fulfillment then failure and reversed order both reach mean1/2 while retaining distinct evidence; unknown and known mixed give same consumer1/2 without same state. Task-only must not change SplitLenses commitment reliance; SingleScore/PersonOnly fail bounded separated fixture,not all competence-informed models. Witnesses do not acquire another own history; target/observer leaves independent. Modifier-off retains learning without response effect. Appraisal40/probe60 before120/140 preserve temporal lag. First6-pass/1-timeout receipt and unexecuted plan retained; successor timeout/path changes preserve original models/fixtures. Seven new tests,328 reference/build are fresh here; inherited23 authority tests are bound prior evidence,not rerun.'),
 (3493,3525,'FAMILIARITY WITHOUT LIKING',evidence('CAMPAIGN3_FAMILIAR_VALENCE_QUALIFICATION.md'),'Seven models27 public runs216 prefixes independently combine feature memory and own signed outcome projection. Same appearance gives familiarity1 with neutral0/positive1/adverse-1 valence and prospective contact1/2,7/9,2/9. Identity comes from separate controlled channel; new Y can resemble X without inheriting X history. PartialMax/ExactOnly differ at1/2 similarity. NoPercept,Unknown incomparable positions,Novel disjoint features and NoHistory remain distinct. FamiliarityAsLiking fails adverse case; ValenceOnly/NoMemory retain independent projections. Projection independence does not imply raw observation-record equality when fields change; whole privacy comparisons remain exact. First encounter cannot match itself before learning140. No sampled contact,forgetting extension,natural recognition or universal liking law; prior peripheral-loss evidence stands separately.'),
 (3526,3557,'DEPENDENCE ATTACHMENT',evidence('CAMPAIGN3_ATTACHMENT_QUALIFICATION.md'),'Six models25 public runs200 prefixes derive Bond from qualifying own meaningful-dependence episodes,not authored meter or actual caregiving pipeline. Source support,goal resolution,prior demand and perceived inability are separately admitted; positive support or hidden capacity alone does not establish resolution/necessity. Two versus one episode changes Bond despite equal mean relief. Adequate alternative/current demand changes practical utility but not missing contact; presence suppresses missing contact while Bond persists. PositiveHistory counts self-sufficient/inactive-demand episodes and fails distinction; CurrentUtilityOnly learns but misses separation at utility0,remaining serious reliable-satisfier control. Witnesses learn person relief without another own history. No Bond is absence of qualifying evidence,not truth of no attachment. Prospective reconnection/assistance not enacted search/contact; modifiers require genuine motives. Mean2/3 versus1/2 retains contradiction control,not full historical precision/decay NeedExpectation port or universal trust/attachment persistence.'),
 (3558,3589,'BETRAYAL APPRAISAL',evidence('CAMPAIGN3_BETRAYAL_QUALIFICATION.md'),'Six models32 public runs288 prefixes keep prior admitted promise,experienced failure,incident intent/control and present willingness separate. Three-valued conjunction is candidate,not betrayal label. Prior means observer-admission chronology,not privileged real-world promise timing; simultaneous/later promise cannot count. First own outcome anchors incident; outcome correction itself unqualified. False linked explanation can remove betrayal under fixed hidden truth without rewriting history or restoring cooperation. Willingness-only changes cooperation while betrayal stays; OutcomeOnly/CurrentPersonBeliefOnly fail distinct controls. Targets/holders own independent state; witnesses do not borrow personal history.27 tests include24 primary and3 first-outcome-write rollback checks,not additional models/runs. Preserve readonly-array build annotation failure with unchanged runtime/model semantics. Prospective information/cooperation probabilities are not enacted confrontation,forgiveness,causal diagnosis or general moral law.'),
]
